    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><strong>Bring friends, fast reactions, wit and courage if you want to survive in RAIDER.</strong> Death or riches is waiting around every corner in this hardcore PvPvE extraction looter. Hunt down giant bosses or take on vicious gangs of bandits as you uncover the dark surprises waiting deep, in a massive unforgiving medieval world.<br><br><br>Slay bosses, hunt horrific beasts and engage enemy players in thrilling PvPvE battles.<br><br><br>Melee, archery and magery combine into a fast flowing and skill based combat system.<br><br><br>Next gen directional melee. Parry, kick, chamber, feint and morph your way to victory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997950/extras/1ffc128301b163cdb7bab7d45cc6f59b.avif?t=1750968792\" /></div><br>Fully projectile archery and magery with a unique sweetspot timing firing system.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997950/extras/e32dae3400c60365ddc359a6f111ca10.avif?t=1750968792\" /></div><br>Fight, loot, gather &amp; craft while gaining XP to customize and level up your Raider.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997950/extras/5c936b52ad195c6e7be14f719684ba59.avif?t=1750968792\" /></div><br>Form a clan, gear up &amp; duel within your camp or upgrade it with resources gathered.<br><br><br>Built from the ground up in Unreal Engine 5 with dedicated servers &amp; matchmaking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Currently in early NA / EU testing</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><strong>Bring friends, fast reactions, wit and courage if you want to survive in RAIDER.</strong> Death or riches is waiting around every corner in this hardcore PvPvE extraction looter. Hunt down giant bosses or take on vicious gangs of bandits as you uncover the dark surprises waiting deep, in a massive unforgiving medieval world.<br><br><br>Slay bosses, hunt horrific beasts and engage enemy players in thrilling PvPvE battles.<br><br><br>Melee, archery and magery combine into a fast flowing and skill based combat system.<br><br><br>Next gen directional melee. Parry, kick, chamber, feint and morph your way to victory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997950/extras/1ffc128301b163cdb7bab7d45cc6f59b.avif?t=1750968792\" /></div><br>Fully projectile archery and magery with a unique sweetspot timing firing system.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997950/extras/e32dae3400c60365ddc359a6f111ca10.avif?t=1750968792\" /></div><br>Fight, loot, gather &amp; craft while gaining XP to customize and level up your Raider.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1997950/extras/5c936b52ad195c6e7be14f719684ba59.avif?t=1750968792\" /></div><br>Form a clan, gear up &amp; duel within your camp or upgrade it with resources gathered.<br><br><br>Built from the ground up in Unreal Engine 5 with dedicated servers &amp; matchmaking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Currently in early NA / EU testing</h2>",
